[
  {
    "start": 3.6,
    "end": 5.96,
    "text": "AI 几秒钟就能解释“善假于物”。",
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.28,
    "text": "可看懂了解释，",
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 7.38,
    "end": 8.73124450872955,
    "text": "我又冒出了一个问题：",
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 9.117760375645108,
    "end": 11.021625,
    "text": "工具能帮我做到越来越多，",
    "segment": 2,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 11.241625,
    "end": 11.981625,
    "text": "那我自己，",
    "segment": 2,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 12.081625,
    "end": 13.000330399429938,
    "text": "还要学什么？",
    "segment": 2,
    "chapter": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 13.693113142761629,
    "end": 14.372248999999998,
    "text": "君子曰：",
    "segment": 3,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 14.532248999999998,
    "end": 15.69366918493666,
    "text": "学不可以已。",
    "segment": 3,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 16.286061999999998,
    "end": 16.636062,
    "text": "青，",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 16.766061999999998,
    "end": 17.566061999999995,
    "text": "取之于蓝，",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 17.726062,
    "end": 18.886061999999995,
    "text": "而青于蓝；",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 19.466061999999997,
    "end": 19.681061999999997,
    "text": "冰，",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 19.706061999999996,
    "end": 20.446061999999994,
    "text": "水为之，",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 20.666061999999997,
    "end": 21.575172003706435,
    "text": "而寒于水。",
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 22.079498999999995,
    "end": 22.939498999999994,
    "text": "青出于蓝，",
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 23.159498999999997,
    "end": 23.959498999999994,
    "text": "水凝成冰。",
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 24.599498999999998,
    "end": 25.039498999999996,
    "text": "学习，",
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 25.319498999999997,
    "end": 27.05428718719554,
    "text": "也应该让我发生变化。",
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 27.410585029923446,
    "end": 28.121373999999996,
    "text": "我想试试：",
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 28.341373999999995,
    "end": 29.441373999999996,
    "text": "暂时不看屏幕，",
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 29.721373999999997,
    "end": 31.421373999999997,
    "text": "能不能把这句话讲清楚，",
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 31.641373999999995,
    "end": 33.13648953130213,
    "text": "再举一个自己的例子。",
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 33.802223132745716,
    "end": 35.193936,
    "text": "吾尝终日而思矣，",
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 35.413936,
    "end": 36.993936,
    "text": "不如须臾之所学也；",
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 37.51393600000001,
    "end": 38.673936000000005,
    "text": "吾尝跂而望矣，",
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 38.833936,
    "end": 40.230030930303165,
    "text": "不如登高之博见也。",
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 40.60040172934343,
    "end": 41.36993700000001,
    "text": "登高而招，",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 41.64993700000001,
    "end": 42.56993700000001,
    "text": "臂非加长也，",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 42.849937,
    "end": 43.70993700000001,
    "text": "而见者远；",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 44.169937000000004,
    "end": 44.969937,
    "text": "顺风而呼，",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 45.129937,
    "end": 46.22993700000001,
    "text": "声非加疾也，",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 46.269937,
    "end": 47.129937,
    "text": "而闻者彰。",
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 47.60107315745394,
    "end": 48.023687,
    "text": "登高，",
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 48.183687,
    "end": 50.12368700000001,
    "text": "让我看见原来看不见的地方。",
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 50.76368700000001,
    "end": 52.40368700000001,
    "text": "AI 也能帮我找资料、",
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 52.56368700000001,
    "end": 53.18368700000001,
    "text": "换个角度。",
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 53.64635342754663,
    "end": 54.535687,
    "text": "省下来的时间，",
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 54.635687,
    "end": 56.035687,
    "text": "我可以用来阅读原文、",
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 56.315687000000004,
    "end": 56.99568700000001,
    "text": "比较解释，",
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 57.15568700000001,
    "end": 58.847589630187876,
    "text": "把没想通的地方接着想。",
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 59.647227282304925,
    "end": 60.564749000000006,
    "text": "假舆马者，",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 60.84474900000001,
    "end": 61.584749,
    "text": "非利足也，",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 61.804749,
    "end": 62.60474900000001,
    "text": "而致千里；",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 63.004749000000004,
    "end": 63.804749000000015,
    "text": "假舟楫者，",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 64.024749,
    "end": 64.82474900000001,
    "text": "非能水也，",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 64.92474899999999,
    "end": 65.724749,
    "text": "而绝江河。",
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 66.23575179033915,
    "end": 67.632186,
    "text": "君子生非异也，",
    "segment": 12,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 67.852186,
    "end": 68.98971073296399,
    "text": "善假于物也。",
    "segment": 12,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 69.38309917900573,
    "end": 70.962373,
    "text": "舟能帮我渡河，",
    "segment": 13,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 71.122373,
    "end": 72.16237300000002,
    "text": "可桨怎么划，",
    "segment": 13,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 72.32237300000001,
    "end": 73.18181653664348,
    "text": "还得看水流。",
    "segment": 13,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 73.61772566766396,
    "end": 74.18181,
    "text": "看一看，",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 74.40181,
    "end": 74.90181000000003,
    "text": "调一调，",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 75.06181000000002,
    "end": 76.70181000000001,
    "text": "才能朝想去的地方走。",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 77.16181000000002,
    "end": 77.54181000000001,
    "text": "原来，",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 77.76181000000001,
    "end": 78.50181000000002,
    "text": "用好工具，",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 78.78181000000002,
    "end": 80.24181,
    "text": "本身也需要学习。",
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 81.190247,
    "end": 81.93024700000001,
    "text": "积土成山，",
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 82.21024700000001,
    "end": 83.01024700000002,
    "text": "风雨兴焉；",
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 83.29024700000002,
    "end": 84.030247,
    "text": "积水成渊，",
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 84.250247,
    "end": 85.04501255270769,
    "text": "蛟龙生焉。",
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 85.4548199340293,
    "end": 86.25230900000001,
    "text": "故不积跬步，",
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 86.292309,
    "end": 87.09230900000001,
    "text": "无以至千里；",
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 87.19230900000001,
    "end": 87.81230900000001,
    "text": "不积小流，",
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 87.852309,
    "end": 88.70400473256286,
    "text": "无以成江海。",
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 89.00479013633186,
    "end": 90.327122,
    "text": "我在纸上写下：",
    "segment": 17,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 90.72712200000001,
    "end": 91.34712200000001,
    "text": "“借助工具，",
    "segment": 17,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 91.62712200000001,
    "end": 93.02712200000002,
    "text": "能让人做到更多。",
    "segment": 17,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 93.4597369856093,
    "end": 94.31037100000002,
    "text": "又添上一句：",
    "segment": 18,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 94.770371,
    "end": 95.390371,
    "text": "“借助工具，",
    "segment": 18,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 95.550371,
    "end": 97.730371,
    "text": "也要把原来不会的东西学会。",
    "segment": 18,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 98.16863834392261,
    "end": 98.73793300000001,
    "text": "写到这里，",
    "segment": 19,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 98.76293300000002,
    "end": 100.222933,
    "text": "我对“学不可以已”，",
    "segment": 19,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 100.382933,
    "end": 101.53074378392918,
    "text": "有了新的理解。",
    "segment": 19,
    "chapter": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 102.26906049355598,
    "end": 103.162558,
    "text": "我又读了一遍：",
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 103.50255800000001,
    "end": 104.90255800000001,
    "text": "“君子生非异也，",
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 105.12255800000001,
    "end": 106.2798982006695,
    "text": "善假于物也。",
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 106.53869301907966,
    "end": 107.74974500000002,
    "text": "这句话让我想到：",
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 107.96974500000002,
    "end": 108.889745,
    "text": "一个普通的人，",
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 108.929745,
    "end": 109.90974500000002,
    "text": "也能通过学习、",
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 110.12974500000001,
    "end": 110.74974500000002,
    "text": "借助外物，",
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 111.02974500000002,
    "end": 112.42335912597659,
    "text": "做到以前做不到的事情。",
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 112.82453614446385,
    "end": 113.196432,
    "text": "以前，",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 113.29643200000002,
    "end": 114.93643200000001,
    "text": "人们借舟楫渡过江河。",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 115.45643200000002,
    "end": 115.80643200000002,
    "text": "今天，",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 115.93643200000001,
    "end": 117.93643200000001,
    "text": "我也可以借助 AI 接触更多知识，",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 117.976432,
    "end": 118.95643200000002,
    "text": "尝试更多想法。",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 119.58743200000002,
    "end": 122.00743200000001,
    "text": "工具让更多事情成为可能，",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 122.46743200000002,
    "end": 124.58743200000002,
    "text": "学习让我把这些帮助，",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 124.62743200000001,
    "end": 126.17682478912084,
    "text": "一点点变成自己的本领。",
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 126.49375302316014,
    "end": 126.84705699999996,
    "text": "所以，",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 126.94705699999999,
    "end": 128.88705699999997,
    "text": "我还要学着提出自己的问题，",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 129.047057,
    "end": 130.147057,
    "text": "分辨不同的解释，",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 130.42705700000002,
    "end": 131.827057,
    "text": "把想法真正做出来。",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 131.86705700000002,
    "end": 132.682057,
    "text": "一次次尝试，",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 132.707057,
    "end": 133.627057,
    "text": "一点点积累，",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 133.84705699999998,
    "end": 135.49865762446203,
    "text": "我也能超越今天的自己。",
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 136.25783057697814,
    "end": 136.99337,
    "text": "“善假于物”，",
    "segment": 24,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 137.15337000000002,
    "end": 138.43337,
    "text": "也要“学不可以已”。",
    "segment": 24,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 138.78794851397936,
    "end": 140.20062000000001,
    "text": "我想借今天的舟楫，",
    "segment": 25,
    "chapter": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 140.30061999999998,
    "end": 142.84062,
    "text": "去抵达昨天还到不了的地方。",
    "segment": 25,
    "chapter": 6
  }
]